# |<----  Preferably limit to 50 characters  ---->|

# Explain WHY this change is being made (not HOW)
# |<----   Try to limit each line to 72 characters   ---->|

# --- COMMIT BODY (Optional but recommended) ---
# Provide additional context about the change:
# - What problem does this solve?
# - Why is this the best approach?
# - What are the trade-offs?

# --- BUG FIXES (If applicable) ---
# Bug #X: [Bug title]
# Root Cause: [Why bug occurred]
# Impact: [Metrics before → after]
# Validation: Job ID [job number]

# --- RELATED REFERENCES ---
# - Issue #X
# - Job ID: [job number]
